Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're weird{**, Onii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You coulda had me if you didn't stop short!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play again, okay?{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time we'll bring Misha too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hesitate?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:00:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.37,0:01:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy Jirov.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing showing up after all this time, son of Alexei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of place this secret village is in?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope we don't have to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll always be welcome at my house if you can pay rent!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:03:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to go sleep in a place with bunch of people like—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, no need to hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My little brothers will soothe your heart that's become as spiky as your hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How many times do I have to tell you not to touch my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.03,0:03:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at our stop. Where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.03,0:03:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I've arranged for a plane from the next town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.37,0:03:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the ancient text on the Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.11,0:03:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a copy of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but I never thought I'd have occasion to look at it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Yuliy's doing right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd told us that we were going to Dogville earlier, then I'm sure he wouldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to find a way to live on his own\Nthis time—one other than killing vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he would have gone alone wherever he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And he{\i1} will{\i0} find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.83,0:03:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can help him as best I can when the time comes, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are like an awkward parent and child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.89,0:03:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A parent would have wished for the happiness of their child, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.37,0:04:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like you wanted to stop him from being happy, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And you still don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Yuliy knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.43,0:04:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.65,0:04:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for us, the vampires would have sucked you dry by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what they were...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can guess why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.77,0:04:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark of Sirius, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been told you know some—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How much do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I once spent a long time traveling around the world searching for the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I first met Alexei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was spooked when I learned that he was a Sirius,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was kind enough to take me to his village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I met his family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You were too young to remember me, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see the Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He suddenly disappeared one day without saying anything, along with the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I somehow managed to sniff out his trail,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and then finally, here in Karafuto...{}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad's alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You found him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be where the Ark—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:47.82,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Just don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to get your hands on the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to what Alexei did, nobody will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:05:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Until this life of mine runs out...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing more to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.65,0:06:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's stop barking up this tree for now.{unintentional dog puns}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I need something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he stays there, they'll go after him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't seem right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is, why did they attack him in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To make him tell them where the Ark—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They learned enough from their text to make it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way they don't know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then to silence him,\Nso that nobody else could learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's just impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Those brats would have been able to kill him in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're saying that they were deliberately keeping him alive until we arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Their actual target may well have been you all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't even spare me a glance, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, one thing's for sure:\Nthey're closer to the Ark than we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be best off hurrying this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but we'll need him to warm up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just what was it that Dad did here in Karafuto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.12,0:07:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And then he jumped out of the smoke and scared Tamara's pants off!{is it okay that they're not wearing pants? :thinking:}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.61,0:07:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, Mikhail?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face tends to have that effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Misha seems cranky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He just wants {*}Lord Yev{*Yev-sama} to pay attention to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.29,0:07:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So Tamara,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.65,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you were talking about Yuliy, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,His name was Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Misha's little brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You met him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we made a promise to play together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We told him we'd bring you along next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuliy's in Karafuto...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll tag along the next time you go to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it at...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.37,0:08:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the sacred ground of the Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you planning on using him for the seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he a noble little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be picking up the slack for his useless elder{repetition}, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to think about how to make the old man talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And to do that, we need a full stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this place here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The gentleman{could be lady, I assume, but who cares} at the harbor told me that it's south Karafuto's tastiest—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.22,0:08:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:08:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those your friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.35,0:09:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...or something?{wow there is no good way to do this}{agreed. no idea if this is better}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I ended up almost running into my father at the port,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:11.00,Default,,2,2,0,,so when I happened to see the Major I ran after him\Nand rushed to get on the same boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd thought for sure that he'd be chasing after you and the other Jaegers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but then I discovered the ship was going to Karafuto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to faint!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault you made a bad assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But since I ended up getting to meet you again here, it was a mistake worth making!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.99,0:09:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect the captain to not only be alive, but also be here in Karafuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.26,0:09:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's definitely the same man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea that the Japanese Army had been searching for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:44.62,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,It seems that every Western power has been searching for the Ark secretly as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what Dad must have been worrying about when he...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did the Professor tell you all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'd done him a bit of a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:10:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... So Yuliy{**-san}'s... father?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's come to Karafuto as well, then? {Not sure if this works}{I like the idea but it looks too much like a mistake}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:10.28,Default,,2,2,0,,So it seems, but pretty-boy's predecessor up in the mountains\Ndoesn't seem to want to tell us what he knows about that.{"senpai" makes it clear as to which pretty boy they're talking about, so i need to add something that makes it similarly clear (I got confused on first watch).}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:14.14,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,In that case, could you take me along next time you go visit?{if this isn't accurate, i beg you to make your vague "too"s a bit clearer in the future}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As his successor, there are plenty of things that I need to ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.04,0:10:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how the captain feels, but you don't need to be so worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that I've come here because the Army ordered me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But after I see the Ark with my own eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.06,0:10:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend to make my own decision as to whether it's something my country truly needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark belongs to the Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant that you get cold easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you can meet your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes down to it, even if we met I don't know what I'd have to say to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even remember his face.{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are dads like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In my case, he's stubborn and naggy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't understand me at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and also, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, that's all I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But I feel like all of that comes from him caring for me in his own way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.82,0:11:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and maybe he's just desperately trying to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He takes pride in protecting his beloved family,{That he's protecting his beloved family, that he has the ability to protect them is what he takes pride in I think.}{not at all confident this I understood this line, but it's a fairly straightforward restructuring of it, so... - motbob}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and in having the ability to protect them, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what a dad is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I may just feel that way because I want it to be the truth, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}My brother{*Nii-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That may have been what {*}my brother{*Nii-san} was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.87,0:12:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He took pride in being able to protect me and Mom as a Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he spent the time to teach me things like how to hunt and defend myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like your brother filled in for your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that {*}my brother{*Nii-san} taught me, Dad taught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The pride of the Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What we have to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}My brother{*Nii-san} learned it all from the dad I never knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So what Dad did here was surely...{just trying to connect it with line 98}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Misha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.97,0:13:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going at this time of day?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Off to give a warning to your dearest brother, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell him to keep away from the Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's the one who was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw come on, that's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A veil of death, descending upon our entire race...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Put him to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My clothes will get dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of your Slaves, Tamara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.43,0:13:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Just do it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.30,0:14:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be more infected aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want that to happen to you, Mikhail,\Nthen just stay put until I have need of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.27,0:14:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, do it right next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.85,0:14:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a major at that age?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be quite talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was bad luck to be appointed my successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:15:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your climb up the ladder has hit a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The military still regards you as missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't been discharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you acquired the Ark, you could return to Japan with your{honor intact or w/e}—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here because I can't acquire it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.57,0:15:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You know where it is, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing where it is doesn't mean I can do anything more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.66,0:15:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then could you please tell me the location of the Ark in order to determine why that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go see for myself why acquisition is impossible\Nand report my findings to our superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If they accept my analysis, then they'll surely relieve us our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have done that yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.35,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you chose not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.73,0:15:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another reason you're still here, isn't—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.77,0:15:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Alexei...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,had me promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.15,0:15:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So you did find Dad here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Old man{*Ojii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.67,0:16:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go back to your village!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The village is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogville is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,vampires who were searching for the Ark attacked it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.41,0:16:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and everyone died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.39,0:16:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what was the point of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, what was the point of Alexei...{i think this gets the point across of "his sacrifice was wasted"}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the last remnant of the Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,As one who lives on, there are things I must know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Dad left with the Ark,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.68,0:16:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,what he tried to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,why he came to Karafuto.{I don't know what puntiation I use to end this type of no-and list}{since they're all things he wants to know, they're sort of questions (so they meet TL accuracy i guess), and they'd be written as statements the way the English is strcutured.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The vampires are still after the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before they reach Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe, in the worst case...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have to get to it as fast as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.05,0:17:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to protect Dad and the Ark from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, {*}old man{*Ojii-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alexei...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had known that he was planning to go that far, I wouldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.17,0:17:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"Go that far"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.15,0:17:43.38,Default,,2,2,0,,He sealed the Ark deep underground in the mountains\Nhere in Karafuto so that none may obtain it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.45,0:17:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if he's alive or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I touched it, I heard his voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.23,0:17:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It said, "Stay away,"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and then, "Tell nobody."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:18:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the promise you made?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't just leave him like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.37,0:18:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought that at least I could live out my...{it's just shifting one inference to another that works better in english}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.52,0:18:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here for his sake, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave up ever going home to Japan and decided to stay by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for thinking of Dad as your friend after all of this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.97,0:18:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.31,0:18:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since then, we've really been...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where Dad and the Ark are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking to you made me almost feel like I was talking to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nothing that I could do for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but maybe his son will have better luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.65,0:19:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Help Alexei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.73,0:19:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.11,0:19:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogville...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Yuliy's birthplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.78,0:19:38.48,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,I never imagined it'd be nestled somewhere like this.{refer to answer of previous TLC question on this subject}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder nobody ever found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If the ancient text is right, then we should find what we're looking for here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.42,0:19:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go ahead and split into two groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.07,0:19:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to put them to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I'll take care of the digging and heavy lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.53,0:19:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.73,0:19:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,England, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better keep sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.93,0:20:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Major! Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Major! Please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are energetic for how early it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.66,0:20:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I haven't even had breakfast yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm not here to talk about that! Yuliy{**-san}'s gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The car's gone, so I think Bishop{**-san}'s gone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow them, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.51,0:20:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But how? We don't have the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember the approximate location from when I saw it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The skill of an imperial soldier at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about leaving those two behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always better for more people to have your back, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm honored that you rely on me,\Nbut I'm not as sure about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.81,0:21:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You ended up letting that\NRoyal brat slip away, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate even suggesting it, but was that pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.61,0:21:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I just didn't like those eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.11,0:21:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know what that means,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.15,0:21:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but keep it together next time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.39,0:23:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our goal is just across that mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.72,0:23:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.84,0:23:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Foooound yoooou!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My name is Klarwein!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.53,0:23:34.06,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So then the real holy grounds are...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.06,0:23:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This place feels eerie as all hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.06,0:23:36.15,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Live in solitude with the Ark...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.15,0:23:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't that right, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.01,0:01:15.02,OP,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.65,0:01:30.69,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an6\c&HECEDEF&\blur0.75\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(460.211,70.999)}If I'm to live\Nby inertia
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.69,0:01:30.73,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an6\c&HF0F0F3&\blur0.75\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(460.62,70.999)}If I'm to live\Nby inertia
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.73,0:01:30.77,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an6\c&HF3F4F6&\blur0.75\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(461.029,70.999)}If I'm to live\Nby inertia
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.77,0:01:30.81,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an6\c&HF7F8F9&\blur0.75\bord0\4a&HFF&\pos(461.441,70.999)}If I'm to live\Nby inertia
