Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:36.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}What an unbearable end
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:43.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}I breath out, breath out, breath out, and stop
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:50.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}As I'm fleeing from this cruel world, I fall into a deep sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.39,0:21:57.57,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}I hide behind the words "I'm doing my best"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.57,0:22:03.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}But in the end I do nothing but look back
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:08.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}Even when I feel like I've been able to change,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.45,0:22:13.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}Eventually I realize that the only thing that's changed is the position of the stars
Dialogue: 5,0:22:15.75,0:22:20.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(965.143,49.715)\blur0.75}I find myself wondering if everything would feel better if I just broke
